      "text": ".filter-1977 {\n  filter: sepia(0.5) hue-rotate(-30deg) saturate(1.4);\n}\n\n.filter-brannan {\n  filter: sepia(0.4) contrast(1.25) brightness(1.1) saturate(0.9) hue-rotate(-2deg);\n}\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
